      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feels a little brittle. Whenever Colitti \u0026 Assoc. adds a new capability, do we have to remember to add it here? If so, is there another way to do this?\n\nAt a minimum, can we add a comment explaining the criteria for a capability to be added here?",
