      "writtenOn": "2020-12-10T00:02:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per offline discussion, the concern here was that some capabilities (eg MMS) may not need to be supported by the VCN on all underlying networks. Specifically, the VCN over WiFi-only MUST be support MMS, but VCN over Cell may not have to.\n\nThis can be implemented as a 2-stage config - a general that is supported across all networks, and transport-specific map that is added/removed dynamically.\n\nHowever, this does require adding/removing some of these capabilities during the network lifecycle, many of which are not considered mutable.\n\nI\u0027ve added a todo regarding this, and suggest punting to post-S.",
