      "message": "While this doesn\u0027t impact Fi, for the general case, a VCN could be roaming or not-roaming and that\u0027s a valuable signal to higher-level callers about (mostly) cost. So think of it as a modifier on the metered bit to say \"not only metered, but unusually expensive\". Given that the VCN, like a cell network, will subsume both types of networks based on whatever the underlying connection is using... we have to find a way to do that.",
